{
  "date": "2025-04-25",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "깨어'났어'??",
      "en": "Are you alive??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 지금 깨어 있어",
      "en": "I'm alive right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 몇번을 깨어라고 말할뻔했는지",
      "en": "You have no idea how many times I almost said \"Are You Alive.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "육각이는 몰라!!",
      "en": "My Hexagons have no idea!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "티저 사진떴는데",
      "en": "The teaser photos are out,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나조차도 내가 어디있는지 모름",
      "en": "and even I couldn't figure out where I was."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우리오빠가 너는 왜 같이 안찍었냐 뭐했냐",
      "en": "My older brother was like, \"Why weren't you in the group photo? What were you doing?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러길래",
      "en": "He said that,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔소리야 하고 봤ㄴ느데 내가 없는거야",
      "en": "so I was like, \"What are you talking about?\" Then I looked, and I couldn't find myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사실 지연언니 옆에 있었지만",
      "en": "I was actually standing next to JiYeon unnie,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나인줄 알았어??",
      "en": "Did you realize it was me??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오호",
      "en": "Oho."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "티저 영상도",
      "en": "I hope the teaser video"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "빨리 뜨면 좋겠다",
      "en": "comes out soon too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "무대 내려오자마자 못했던 얘기 막 하려고",
      "en": "As soon as I got off stage, I rushed over because I wanted to tell you everything I couldn't say before."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "달려왔징",
      "en": "So I came running."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "블소드 티저도 떳네",
      "en": "The Black Soul Dress teaser is out too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러고보니",
      "en": "Come to think of it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "올빽!!!",
      "en": "I did the all-back hairstyle!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "했어",
      "en": "I really did."
    },
        {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "정하연 입 근질근질 하던거 벅벅 긁네 지금",
      "en": "Looks like you're finally scratching that itch to talk now, Jeong HaYeon."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시원하다",
      "en": "That feels so refreshing."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "영상 모니터링 할때도",
      "en": "Even while monitoring the video,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나쁘지 않아",
      "en": "I thought it didn't look bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나오면",
      "en": "When it comes out,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나만 봐",
      "en": "only look at me."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아맞다 오늘 시그널도 리라하연이야 오늘 진짜행복해",
      "en": "Oh right, today's SIGNAL is Lila HaYeon too. I'm seriously so happy today."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐야~~",
      "en": "Aww, what~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이것도 진짜 말하고싶었는데",
      "en": "I really wanted to talk about this too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 숨기던게 풀리기 시작하니까",
      "en": "Now that all the things we've been keeping secret are finally starting to be revealed,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맘이 편하네",
      "en": "I feel so relieved."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좀따 꼭봥",
      "en": "Make sure you watch it later."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이번 뮤비 진짜 멋질거같아",
      "en": "I think this music video is going to be really cool."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 기대된다",
      "en": "I'm so excited."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "촌캉스2화도 낼 나오네",
      "en": "Countryside Vacation Episode 2 comes out tomorrow too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "도파민 축제네",
      "en": "It's going to be a dopamine festival."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "와",
      "en": "Wow."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "볼거 넘많아",
      "en": "There's so much to watch."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시간 빼놔💕",
      "en": "Make sure you set some time aside. 💕"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "블소드도 내일??",
      "en": "Black Soul Dress is tomorrow too??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "와",
      "en": "Wow."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 하루종일 그냥 폰만 해야겠는걸",
      "en": "I'm seriously going to be on my phone all day."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "벚꽃 오브젝트! 맞아",
      "en": "Oh, the Cherry Blossom Objekt! That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "1년만에",
      "en": "For the first time in a year,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "찍었는데",
      "en": "I filmed one."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "구미호같이 나왔어",
      "en": "I ended up looking like a gumiho."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가",
      "en": "Somehow,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "간빼먹을거같이",
      "en": "I looked like I was about to steal someone's liver."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사악하게 나와서",
      "en": "I looked so mischievous."
